  "body": "* Brand-new home offering four bedrooms, three bathrooms and two living areas\r\n* Approx. 162sqm floor area on a 324sqm section\r\n* Flexible layout with dedicated space for extended family, guests or independent living\r\n* Open-plan kitchen, dining and main living area with excellent connection to the outdoors\r\n* Contemporary kitchen with a generous island, quality appliances and ample storage\r\n* Sunny deck and landscaped garden providing an inviting outdoor extension of the living areas\r\n* One-bedroom, one-living-area, one-bathroom zone offering excellent granny potential and added privacy\r\n* Master bedroom with a walk-in wardrobe and ensuite\r\n* Two additional bedrooms plus a modern family bathroom with bathtub\r\n* Single internal-access garage with convenient entry and additional storage\r\n* 10-Year Master Build Guarantee for added peace of mind\r\n\r\nDesigned with flexibility in mind, this brand-new Orewa home offers a layout that can adapt beautifully to different stages of family life. With four bedrooms, three bathrooms and two living areas, there is space to come together, spread out, or create a little separation when needed.\r\n\r\nThe main living area brings the kitchen, dining and lounge together in a bright and welcoming setting. A generous kitchen island, quality appliances and plenty of storage make the space as practical as it is stylish, while large sliding doors open onto the sunny deck and landscaped garden. Whether hosting friends, enjoying an outdoor meal or simply relaxing at home, the connection between inside and out makes everyday living feel effortless.\r\n\r\nOne of the home's standout features is its flexible additional living zone, comprising one bedroom, one living area and one bathroom. With its own sense of separation from the main living spaces, this area offers excellent potential for extended family, older children, guests or those wanting greater independence while remaining close to the household.\r\n\r\nThe master bedroom provides a private retreat with a generous walk-in wardrobe and ensuite, while two further bedrooms offer comfortable accommodation for family members, guests or a home office. A modern family bathroom with bathtub adds further practicality to the layout.\r\n\r\nA single internal-access garage provides secure parking, direct access into the home and useful additional storage, completing a home designed around convenience and flexibility.\r\n\r\nThe location adds another layer of appeal, with schools, parks, shops, cafés, supermarkets, public transport and local walking tracks all within easy reach. Orewa Beach is only minutes away, offering an easy change of pace whenever you want to enjoy the coastline, while motorway connections make travel towards Auckland City and the North Shore straightforward.\r\n\r\nWhether you need room for a growing family, space for extended family, or simply value having different ways to use your home, 57 Huanui Drive offers the flexibility to make the space work for you - now and into the future.\r\n\r\nContact Team Vinson & Amy on 022 571 7074 to arrange your private viewing or visit one of our upcoming open homes. Learn more at www.vinsonamyandco.nz.",
